# Cursor Rules for ar-io-marketplace-process

## Log File Naming Convention

When creating or outputting log files, always use the `.log` file extension. This extension is already included in `.gitignore` (pattern: `*.log`), ensuring that log files are automatically excluded from version control.

Examples:
- ✅ `e2e-test-run-1763480021.log`
- ✅ `test-output.log`
- ✅ `debug-session.log`
- ❌ `test-output.txt`
- ❌ `debug.json` (when used for logging)

